---
import { image } from '~/data/content';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="ritual" id="ritual">
  <div class="ritual-photo"><img src={image('ritual')} alt="A woman taking a quiet moment for her skincare ritual" width="1000" height="1200" loading="lazy" /></div>
  <div class="ritual-copy"><h2>Not a routine.<br /><em>Your ritual.</em></h2><p>Some days, a little glow is all you need.<br />Others call for a flush of colour.<br />There’s no one way to be you.</p><p>Tell us what you’re in the mood for.<br />We’ll help you find your kind of beauty.</p><button class="button" data-open-quiz>Find my ritual<Icon name="arrow" /></button><span class="ritual-note">Two little questions. A ritual that’s yours.</span></div>
</section>
<style>
  .ritual{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:var(--color-mauve)}.ritual-photo{min-height:580px;overflow:hidden}.ritual-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;max-height:650px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%}.ritual-copy{padding:70px 7vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:start}.ritual-copy h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,70px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:28px}.ritual-copy h2 em{font-style:italic}.ritual-copy p{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.9}.ritual-copy .button{margin-top:12px}.ritual-note{font-size:9px;margin-top:16px;color:var(--color-espresso)}
  @media(max-width:700px){.ritual{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ritual-photo{min-height:0;height:390px}.ritual-photo img{object-position:center 35%}.ritual-copy{padding:45px 6vw 50px}.ritual-copy h2{font-size:49px}.ritual-copy p{font-size:12px}}
</style>
